{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":15,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܡܵܢܝܼ ܡܵܨܹܐ ܥܵܡܹܪ ܒܡܲܫܟܢܘܼܟ݂؟","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܢܝܼ ܡܵܨܹܐ ܫܵܪܹܐ ܒܛܘܼܪܵܐ ܕܩܘܼܕܫܘܼܟ݂؟","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗ̇ܘ ܕܚܵܕܹܪ ܒܬܲܡܝܼܡܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܘܦܵܠܹܚ ܙܲܕܝܼܩܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܗܲܡܙܸܡ ܫܪܵܪܵܐ ܒܠܸܒܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܠܹܐ ܕܵܪܹܐ ܒܘܼܚܬܵܢ ܒܠܸܫܵܢܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܠܹܐ ܥܵܒܹܕ ܒܝܼܫܬܵ‌ܐ ܠܚܲܒ݂ܪܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܠܹܐ ܡܲܪܸܡ ܠܵܘܡܵܐ ܥܲܠܔ ܫܒ݂ܵܒܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܒܥܲܝܢܘܼ̈ܗ‌ܝ ܦܝܼܫ ܠܹܗ ܡܘܼܣܠܝܼܵܐ ܟܵܦܘܿܪܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܟܹܐ ܡܝܲܩܸܪ ܠܙܕܝܼ̈ܥܹܐ ܕܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܟܹܐ ܝܵܡܹܐ ܠܓܵܢܹܗ ܘܠܹܐ ܫܲܚܠܸܦ، ܐܵܦܸܢ ܕܐܵܬܝܵܐ ܥܲܠܘܼܗ‌ܝ ܒܝܼܫܬܵ‌ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܠܹܐ ܡܲܕܝܸܢ ܣܹܐܡܹܗ ܒܙܵܘܕܘܼܢܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܠܹܐ ܫܵܩܹܠܔ ܪܸܫܘܲܬ ܥܲܠܔ ܙܲܟܵܝܵܐ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܵܒ݂ܕܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܐܲܢܹܐ ܠܹܐ ܫܵܥܹܫ ܠܥܵܠܲܡ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}